# Chapter 9 — Smart Card Generation & Anki Integration

## Milestone 9.1 — AI Card Enhancement

### Vision

The Language Analysis Engine already provides deterministic linguistic information such as readings, meanings, grammar, kanji data, and translations.

The purpose of AI Card Enhancement is **not** to regenerate this information, but to enrich generated study cards with contextual learning material that is difficult to derive deterministically.

The AI enhances existing cards rather than generating them.

