## Design Goals

- AI enhances cards without replacing deterministic analysis.
- Generated cards remain editable before export.
- Enhancement providers remain completely provider-independent.
- Deterministic data always takes precedence over AI.
- Enhancement requests remain inexpensive and fast.

---

## AI Responsibilities

The AI generates only:

### Example Sentence

A natural Japanese sentence using the target vocabulary or grammar.

---

### Sentence Translation

A concise English translation of the generated sentence.

---

### Usage Note

A very short explanation such as:

- Common usage
- Formality
- Typical nuance
- Common learner mistake (if applicable)

Maximum:

2–3 short sentences.

---

## AI Must Never Generate

The AI must never determine:

- Meaning
- Reading
- Furigana
- Grammar
- Kanji information
- JLPT level
- Pitch accent
- Dictionary definitions

Those always come from the Language Analysis Engine.

